## Upstream project (Copyright (c) 2025 PAI-RAG Contributors)

NexaMind AI is built on PAI-RAG by aigc-apps (https://github.com/aigc-apps/PAI-RAG),
used under the MIT License. The PAI-RAG copyright notice is retained in LICENSE.
The following components are derived from PAI-RAG and are NOT original to NexaMind AI:

- `backend/` — the FastAPI application, RAG pipeline, model / tool / agent services,
  configuration APIs, database models, and the Alembic migrations (`alembic/`)
- `frontend/` — the Next.js application, based on PAI-RAG's frontend
- `integrations/pairag-file/` — the PAI-RAG file processing library (v2.1.38)
- `skills/pairag-knowledge/` — the PAI-RAG knowledge-base CLI search skill
- `tests/`, `resources/`, `scripts/`, `examples/`, `docker/`, `Makefile`,
  `pyproject.toml`, `alembic.ini` — derived from or adapted from PAI-RAG

A small number of files carry their own upstream notices. For example,
